      "Frame 32: robot_1 is now directly behind laundry_cart_1, facing generally toward the camera and leaning slightly toward the cart. Its image-left arm extends outward, while its image-right gripper is nearer the cart and supports or contacts a long white hanging textile. This textile cannot be confidently assigned to towel_1, towel_2, towel_3, or towel_4; their previously tracked folded grouping remains on wall_shelving_unit_1, with individual identities unresolved. The cart is within immediate hand-contact distance. folding_table_1 is adjacent image-left and largely clear. The robot is approximately a meter or more from the wall shelving, where folded_linen_stack_1, folded_linen_stack_2, and folded_linen_stack_3 remain visible. orange_storage_cabinet_1 and wall_mounted_hose_1 remain behind-left. black_storage_rack_1 holds folded_linen_stack_4; metal_storage_rack_1 holds folded_linen_stack_5 above its supplies. detergent_container_1, detergent_container_2, and spray_bottle_1 remain individually unresolved. laundry_cart_2 stands farther back to the right. front_loading_laundry_machine_1 and front_loading_laundry_machine_2 remain several meters image-right, with no visible state change. recessed_ceiling_light_1 and recessed_ceiling_light_2 remain illuminated."
