      "Frame 11: robot_01 has both grippers beneath or beside the front edges of server_02, which now projects horizontally from rack_01 toward its torso. The robot remains slightly crouched, with its elbows bent and head directed down toward the chassis. Its base has edged left, increasing lateral separation from white table_01 while maintaining a short distance to the rack. server_01 remains on table_01 beside coiled cable_01. table_02 is still empty and lies to the robot's left. cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 remain in their upper rack loops. tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 are partly hidden behind the chassis and arms. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain fixed. shelf_01 holds stationary computer_01\u2013computer_10, and shelf_02 holds stationary computer_11\u2013computer_17. monitor_01 and monitor_02 remain dark, while cabinet_01 remains below the left monitor.",
      "Frame 12: server_02 is clearly outside rack_01 and supported between robot_01's two grippers. The flat gray chassis is tilted steeply, with its upper end pointing toward the rack and its lower end near the robot's chest. robot_01 turns its torso and base leftward, away from the rack, while keeping both elbows bent around the chassis. The distance between the chassis and rack is increasing. server_01 remains horizontal on table_01, and cable_01 remains coiled at the rear-right corner. table_02 remains empty ahead and to the robot's left. cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 are unchanged. tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 remain at the lower rack front, partially visible behind the moving robot. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain stationary. shelf_01 with computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02 with computer_11\u2013computer_17, dark monitor_01 and monitor_02, and cabinet_01 retain their positions.",
      "Frame 13: robot_01 has rotated toward wooden table_02, presenting its front more clearly to the camera. It carries server_02 across its body with both grippers, now at a shallower diagonal and approximately waist height. Its base has moved leftward into the open floor between the tables, increasing its distance from rack_01 and reducing its distance from table_02. The head tilts toward the chassis. server_01 remains on white table_01 beside cable_01. table_02 is still clear immediately ahead of the carried server. rack_01, cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 remain unchanged; tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 are less obscured as the robot moves away. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain at far right. shelf_01 and computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02 and computer_11\u2013computer_17, monitor_01, monitor_02, and cabinet_01 remain stationary; both monitors are dark.",
      "Frame 14: robot_01 leans over the right edge of table_02 and lowers server_02 toward the wooden surface. The chassis is nearly horizontal, with much of its broad gray top over the table and its near-right edge still adjacent to both grippers. The robot's head points downward, and the base is close enough that its forearms reach over the tabletop. server_01 remains on table_01 across the aisle, with cable_01 still coiled behind it. rack_01 is now behind and to the robot's right; cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 remain looped in place. tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 remain at the lower rack front. rack_02 and power_strip_01 are unchanged at the far right. shelf_01 and computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02 and computer_11\u2013computer_17, dark monitor_01 and monitor_02, and cabinet_01 remain stationary.",
