      "Frame 16: robot_01 has pulled both empty-looking grippers clear of server_02 and rotated back toward white table_01. Its torso is more upright, its forearms are held apart at waist height, and its base is moving into the gap between the tables. server_02 remains stationary and fully supported on table_02, with a visible gap separating it from the hands. server_01 remains on table_01, with cable_01 still coiled behind it. rack_01 lies immediately beyond the robot's new facing direction; cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 retain their positions. tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 remain at the lower rack front. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain at far right. shelf_01 with computer_01\u2013computer_10 and shelf_02 with computer_11\u2013computer_17 are unchanged. monitor_01 and monitor_02 remain dark, and cabinet_01 remains stationary.",
      "Frame 17: robot_01 approaches table_01 and extends both arms toward server_01. Its screen-right gripper reaches toward the chassis's far-right side while the other remains near its left/front edge. The head points down at the server, and the base is now close to the table's left edge. server_01 still rests horizontally on the tabletop; cable_01 remains coiled just beyond its right-rear area. server_02 stays flat on table_02, now behind and to the robot's left. rack_01 stands behind the white table and robot, with cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 unchanged. tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 remain partly occluded. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain stationary at far right. shelf_01, computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02, computer_11\u2013computer_17, dark monitor_01 and monitor_02, and cabinet_01 are unchanged.",
