      "Frame 29: robot_01 has turned back toward rack_01 and retracted its arms from table_01. Both grippers are in front of its torso at roughly lower-chest height. cable_01 is no longer visible on the now-clear white tabletop; any cable held between the hands is too obscured to trace confidently. The robot's base has moved leftward and closer to a direct approach to the rack. server_01 remains not individually distinguishable in rack_01. server_02 remains flat on table_02. tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 remain at the rack's lower front, within reach of the robot. cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 retain their loops. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain fixed at far right. shelf_01 and computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02 and computer_11\u2013computer_17, dark monitor_01 and monitor_02, and cabinet_01 remain unchanged.",
      "Frame 30: robot_01 bends forward and lowers both hands toward tray_01 and the equipment immediately above it on rack_01. Its head points down, the elbows are drawn close together, and the base remains directly in front of the rack. keyboard_01 and mouse_01 are visible beside or beneath the grippers; the hands obscure the exact contact area. table_01 is clear of server_01 and cable_01. server_01 is indistinct within the rack, and cable_01 cannot be confidently located in the hand/rack area. server_02 remains stationary on table_02. cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 remain unchanged higher up. rack_02 and power_strip_01 stay fixed at far right. shelf_01 with computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02 with computer_11\u2013computer_17, dark monitor_01 and monitor_02, and cabinet_01 retain their positions.",
      "Frame 31: robot_01 remains deeply bent toward the lower front of rack_01, with its hands close to the right half of tray_01. The white mouse_01 and keyboard_01 remain on the tray, partially obscured by the forearms; neither shows a clearly resolved displacement. The robot's base has shifted slightly right, keeping its torso close to the rack and increasing its distance from table_02. table_01 remains clear. server_01 is not separately distinguishable within rack_01, cable_01 remains untraceable in the occluded working area, and server_02 remains flat on table_02. cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 are stationary above. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain unchanged at the right edge. shelf_01 and computer_01\u2013computer_10, shelf_02 and computer_11\u2013computer_17, monitor_01, monitor_02, and cabinet_01 remain stationary, with both monitors dark.",
      "Frame 32: robot_01 has straightened substantially, backed away from rack_01, and rotated toward the camera and left side of the room. Its elbows are bent, with both green-surfaced grippers gathered in front of its chest and its head angled toward them. No separate large chassis is visible in its hands. The increased gap from rack_01 exposes tray_01, keyboard_01, and mouse_01 behind it. table_01 remains clear of both server_01 and cable_01; server_01 is not separately identifiable in the rack, and cable_01 cannot be confidently located. server_02 remains flat near the inner edge of table_02, a short distance to the robot's left. cable_02, cable_03, and cable_04 remain looped in rack_01. rack_02 and power_strip_01 remain cropped at far right. shelf_01 retains computer_01\u2013computer_10, and shelf_02 retains computer_11\u2013computer_17 in their original groups. monitor_01 and monitor_02 remain dark, and cabinet_01 remains stationary."
