      "Frame 26: robot_arm_1 has withdrawn sharply toward the left, leaving robot_gripper_1 open and well separated from the charger. robot_arm_2 keeps robot_gripper_2 vertically above battery_charger_1, with its fingers beside the exposed battery tops. battery_1, battery_2, and battery_3 remain closely grouped in upright or slightly inclined positions within the charger; no battery is visibly carried away by the left gripper. orange_storage_bin_1 stays to the right with no robot contact. charger_power_cable_1 remains slack in its foreground curve. work_table_1, white_work_surface_mat_1, orange_tape_strip_1, and robot_support_column_1 are unchanged. robot_cable_1 extends outward with the retreating left arm, while robot_cable_2 stays near the central right wrist. background_workbench_1, red_storage_bin_1, blue_storage_bin_1, and blue_storage_bin_2 remain fixed.",
      "Frame 27: robot_arm_2 lifts robot_gripper_2 upward and slightly rightward, exposing the battery cluster more clearly. robot_arm_1 holds robot_gripper_1 open on the left, also clear of the charger. battery_1, battery_2, and battery_3 remain projecting from battery_charger_1, with closely spaced silver upper sections and dark lower portions. Both grippers now have visible air gaps from the batteries. orange_storage_bin_1 remains farther right on the mat. charger_power_cable_1, work_table_1, white_work_surface_mat_1, orange_tape_strip_1, and robot_support_column_1 retain their positions. robot_cable_1 hangs beside the left arm; robot_cable_2 includes a loose loop beneath the raised right gripper. background_workbench_1 remains behind the scene with red_storage_bin_1 at left and blue_storage_bin_1 and blue_storage_bin_2 at right.",
      "Frame 28: robot_arm_1 rotates inward and downward, turning robot_gripper_1 so its housing is more horizontal and its orange tips point toward the central charger. robot_arm_2 lowers and angles robot_gripper_2 down-left, remaining above-right of battery_charger_1. battery_1, battery_2, and battery_3 remain visibly grouped in the charger, with neither gripper clearly contacting them yet. The left gripper is approaching the cluster from above-left; the right gripper maintains a small gap on the opposite side. orange_storage_bin_1 remains stationary. charger_power_cable_1, work_table_1, white_work_surface_mat_1, orange_tape_strip_1, and robot_support_column_1 are unchanged. robot_cable_1 swings across the left arm, and robot_cable_2 retains its small hanging loop. background_workbench_1, red_storage_bin_1, blue_storage_bin_1, and blue_storage_bin_2 remain fixed.",
      "Frame 29: robot_arm_1 moves farther over the charger, its white forearm occupying much of the upper-left center. robot_gripper_1 points down into battery_charger_1, with orange fingertips contacting or immediately bordering the upper ends of battery_1, battery_2, and battery_3. Their individual surfaces are partly concealed by the fingers. robot_arm_2 holds robot_gripper_2 just right of the interaction, angled toward the left gripper and separated by only a small gap. orange_storage_bin_1 remains untouched to the right. battery_charger_1 and charger_power_cable_1 stay fixed. work_table_1, white_work_surface_mat_1, orange_tape_strip_1, and robot_support_column_1 retain their positions, though the column is partly blocked by the arms. robot_cable_1 crosses the left arm's foreground silhouette; robot_cable_2 hangs below the right gripper. background_workbench_1 retains red_storage_bin_1, blue_storage_bin_1, and blue_storage_bin_2.",
      "Frame 30: robot_arm_1 maintains its low, inward-reaching posture, with robot_gripper_1 directly over battery_charger_1. Its orange fingers remain close around the exposed battery cluster; battery_1, battery_2, and battery_3 are partially visible below the gripper, with no clear removal or large displacement. robot_arm_2 and robot_gripper_2 remain immediately to the right, angled down-left and close to the left gripper without a clearly visible grasp on a battery. orange_storage_bin_1 stays separated on the right. charger_power_cable_1 remains slack and unchanged. work_table_1, white_work_surface_mat_1, orange_tape_strip_1, and robot_support_column_1 remain stationary. robot_cable_1 hangs across the inward left arm, and robot_cable_2 retains a small loop near its gripper. background_workbench_1, red_storage_bin_1, blue_storage_bin_1, and blue_storage_bin_2 remain unchanged.",
