      "Frame 5: Part_08 now stands upright in fixture_06 at the far-right edge of board_01. Gripper_01 has released it and is lifting and shifting leftward, leaving a visible gap between the fingers and the pin. Robot_01's wrist remains above the board's middle-right region. Fixture_01, fixture_02, fixture_03, fixture_04, and fixture_05 remain unoccupied. Part_01 and part_02 remain on table_01 to the left, alongside patterned cube part_04 and slotted rectangular part_05. Part_03 is still a small yellow shape near the robot base. Part_06, part_07, part_09, and part_10 remain loose among the smaller scattered components. The board and tabletop do not move; the upright far-right pin is the only clearly installed yellow part.",
