      "Frame 3: robot_1 holds its base nearly stationary close to the back cabinets. Its left elbow rises and bends inward, carrying the left gripper higher and toward the upper/front area of microwave_1; the right arm stays raised near the appliance's right side. The left gripper is now within close reaching distance of the door. microwave_1 remains closed, with microwave_turntable_1 obscured. white_cup_1 is not clearly identifiable. refrigerator_1 is closed, and sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged with no visible water. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1, while right_countertop_1 stays empty. upper_cabinet_1 and upper_cabinet_2 remain closed, as do lower_cabinet_1 and lower_cabinet_2. drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 4: With its base essentially fixed, robot_1 brings its left gripper across the space above and beside its head toward the front of microwave_1. Much of the left forearm is hidden behind the head and torso, and the gripper approaches or overlaps the microwave-door area. Its right arm retains the raised, bent posture. microwave_1 still appears closed; microwave_turntable_1 is not visible. white_cup_1 remains indistinct. refrigerator_1 remains closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 are stationary with no visible stream. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 are unchanged. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain together on back_countertop_1; right_countertop_1 remains clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 all remain closed.",
      "Frame 5: robot_1 stays close to the counter with its left gripper immediately in front of microwave_1, partly overlapping the door region above the robot's head. The left arm is mostly occluded by the body, while the right arm remains raised beside the microwave controls. The microwave door is still approximately flush with the appliance front; microwave_turntable_1 remains concealed. white_cup_1 cannot be reliably distinguished. refrigerator_1 stays closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged and dry-looking, with no running water visible. cooking_pot_1 remains on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 are stationary on back_countertop_1, and right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, and lower_cabinet_2 are closed, together with drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6.",
      "Frame 6: microwave_1 is now open, with its door swung outward to the left and its pale interior exposed. The dark circular microwave_turntable_1 is visible along the cavity bottom. robot_1 has moved slightly backward and screen-left, increasing the torso-to-counter gap, while its raised left gripper is near the open door's outer portion. The right gripper remains lifted near the microwave's right side. white_cup_1 is not clearly resolved as a separate object. refrigerator_1 remains closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 are unchanged, with the open microwave door occupying space nearer the sink. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 remain stationary. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1; right_countertop_1 remains clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, and drawer_1 through drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 7: robot_1 remains slightly farther from the cabinetry than before the door opened. Its left arm is held up near the leftward-projecting microwave door; its right arm remains bent upward. microwave_1 stays open, exposing the pale cavity and microwave_turntable_1, although the robot's head partly blocks the lower-left interior. white_cup_1 is not clearly distinguishable. refrigerator_1 is closed, while sink_1 and faucet_1 show no motion or water flow. cooking_pot_1 remains on cooktop_1 and oven_1 stays closed. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain grouped on back_countertop_1 to the right of the microwave. Empty right_countertop_1 continues along the robot's right side toward the camera. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 8: The door of microwave_1 is clearly extended leftward, nearly perpendicular to the appliance front. robot_1's left gripper is beside the outer edge of the door near the sink side, with the left elbow bent outward; its right gripper remains raised on the opposite side. The base holds position, leaving the door within arm's reach. microwave_turntable_1 remains visible inside. white_cup_1 remains difficult to separate from nearby white objects. refrigerator_1 is closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain stationary with no visible water. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 are unchanged. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1; right_countertop_1 is empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, and lower_cabinet_2 remain shut, along with drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6.",
      "Frame 9: robot_1 lowers and retracts its left arm away from the open microwave door, bringing the left gripper down toward the left side of its torso. Its right arm remains raised and its base changes little. The left gripper is now farther from the door than in the preceding frame. microwave_1 remains fully open, and microwave_turntable_1 is visible in the unobstructed lower-right cavity. white_cup_1 is not clearly identifiable. refrigerator_1 remains closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged without visible water flow. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1, and right_countertop_1 remains clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 10: robot_1 holds its left arm lowered and bent outward, with the left gripper near torso height. Its right gripper is still elevated in front of the counter to the right of microwave_1. The base remains a short distance from the back cabinetry. microwave_1 stays open to the left; microwave_turntable_1 is visible inside. white_cup_1 is not independently resolved in the area near the robot's right gripper and countertop. refrigerator_1 is closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 are unchanged, with no visible water. cooktop_1 supports cooking_pot_1, and oven_1 remains closed beneath it. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1; right_countertopop_1 is not a separate object, and the visible right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, and drawer_1 through drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 11: robot_1 rolls forward and slightly screen-right, closing the gap to the back cabinets and aligning more directly with the space between microwave_1 and the lemons. Its left arm remains bent low, while its right arm stays raised above the nearby countertop. The right gripper is now closer to the small objects beside the microwave. microwave_1 remains open, and microwave_turntable_1 is visible. white_cup_1 is not clearly separable from the pale objects around the right gripper. refrigerator_1 is closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain stationary without visible water. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 remain unchanged. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain grouped on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 is empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain shut.",
      "Frame 12: robot_1 extends its right forearm forward and downward toward back_countertop_1 immediately left of the lemons. The right gripper reaches approximately countertop height, overlapping the area where white_cup_1 is located; the cup and gripper are not cleanly separable at this resolution. Its left arm remains lowered, and the base is close to the cabinets. microwave_1 remains open with microwave_turntable_1 visible inside. refrigerator_1 stays closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged with no visible water flow. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain just to the right of the reaching gripper. right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 13: robot_1 holds its right gripper low and forward over back_countertop_1, immediately beside the lemon group. The gripper overlaps white_cup_1's apparent position, obscuring the exact contact and grasp configuration. Its left arm remains bent outward at a lower height, and the base stays near the cabinet fronts. microwave_1 remains open to the left, exposing microwave_turntable_1. refrigerator_1 is closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 are unchanged, with no visible stream. cooktop_1 and cooking_pot_1 remain stationary above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on the countertop without an evident displacement. right_countertop_1 remains clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, and lower_cabinet_2 remain closed, as do drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6.",
      "Frame 14: robot_1 begins withdrawing from the counter, shifting slightly backward and screen-left. Its right elbow bends and lifts the right gripper above the countertop; a pale shape associated with white_cup_1 is partly merged with the gripper and cannot be fully outlined. The left arm remains low. The right hand is farther from lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 than in the preceding frame. microwave_1 stays open, and microwave_turntable_1 is visible. refrigerator_1 remains closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 are unchanged without visible water flow. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. The lemons remain on back_countertop_1, and right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 are shut.",
      "Frame 15: robot_1 has rolled substantially backward and screen-left, widening the floor gap between its base and the back cabinetry. Both arms remain bent, with the left gripper low and outward and the right gripper above shoulder level. white_cup_1 is largely obscured by or visually merged with the right gripper. The open microwave is now farther from the torso, near the outer part of the arm's reach. microwave_1 remains open, with microwave_turntable_1 visible. refrigerator_1 is closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 show no change or flowing water. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 remain stationary. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 is empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, and drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 16: robot_1 holds its base at the more withdrawn position and raises its right gripper higher, bringing it roughly level with the lower portion of microwave_1. Its right forearm becomes more upright while the left arm stays low and outward. white_cup_1 remains partly hidden in the right-gripper area; no unobstructed view of its full shape is available. microwave_1 stays open, exposing microwave_turntable_1. refrigerator_1 remains closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 are unchanged, with no visible water. cooking_pot_1 remains on cooktop_1, and oven_1 stays closed. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 are stationary on back_countertop_1, some distance to the right of the raised hand. right_countertop_1 is clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, and drawer_1 through drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 17: robot_1 rotates its raised right forearm inward toward its head and the open microwave. The right gripper moves screen-left and slightly upward, reducing its lateral separation from the cavity while the base remains back from the counter. white_cup_1 is still partly obscured at the gripper. The left arm retains its lower, outward-bent position. microwave_1 remains open, and microwave_turntable_1 is visible inside. refrigerator_1 is closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain stationary, with no running water visible. cooktop_1 supports cooking_pot_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain together on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain shut.",
      "Frame 18: robot_1 rolls forward and screen-right toward microwave_1 while keeping its right elbow high and its right gripper near the upper-right side of its head. This combined base and arm motion brings the gripper and partly occluded white_cup_1 closer to the microwave opening. The left arm remains lowered and bent. microwave_1 stays open, with microwave_turntable_1 visible beneath the cavity opening. refrigerator_1 remains closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 are unchanged without visible water flow. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1, and oven_1 remains closed. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1 to the robot's right. right_countertop_1 remains clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 19: robot_1 is again close to the back cabinetry, with its base nearly below microwave_1. Its raised right gripper is immediately in front of the open cavity, while the right forearm forms a steep diagonal upward. white_cup_1 remains partially hidden by the gripper and robot head near the opening. The left arm stays low and outward, clear of the door. microwave_1 remains open; microwave_turntable_1 is partly visible below the occluding head and hand. refrigerator_1 is closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged with no visible water. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 are stationary. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1; right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, and drawer_1 through drawer_6 remain shut.",
      "Frame 20: robot_1 extends or angles its right gripper into the open front of microwave_1, bringing the hand close to the lower interior and microwave_turntable_1. Its head and wrist obscure much of the contact area. white_cup_1 is not separately outlined at this instant, being within the same occluded region. The base remains close to the cabinets, and the left arm stays lowered. microwave_1's door remains swung left. refrigerator_1 is closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 show no change or visible flowing water. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain together on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 21: robot_1 holds nearly the same close position at microwave_1, with its right wrist and gripper overlapping the cavity's lower-right region. The head conceals much of the interior, so the exact position of white_cup_1 relative to the gripper and microwave_turntable_1 is not directly visible. Its left arm remains low and outward. microwave_1 stays open. refrigerator_1 is closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain stationary, with no visible water stream. cooktop_1 supports cooking_pot_1, and oven_1 remains closed below. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 stay on back_countertop_1, beyond the robot's right side. right_countertop_1 remains clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain shut.",
      "Frame 22: robot_1 withdraws slightly backward and screen-left while drawing its right arm away from the microwave interior. The right gripper passes beside the robot's head, increasing its distance from the cavity. A small pale upright object consistent with white_cup_1 is now visible inside microwave_1 near the right side of microwave_turntable_1. The door remains open to the left, and the left arm stays lowered. refrigerator_1 remains closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 are unchanged without visible water flow. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 remain stationary. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain grouped on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 is empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 23: robot_1 holds a slightly withdrawn stance. Its right arm has returned to a raised, outward-bent position with the gripper clear of microwave_1, while its left arm remains lower. white_cup_1 appears as a small upright pale shape inside the open cavity, positioned over microwave_turntable_1. The microwave door remains fully leftward. refrigerator_1 is closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged, with no visible water. cooking_pot_1 remains on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1, to the right of the microwave and beyond the robot's right forearm. right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 24: robot_1 remains nearly stationary with its right gripper raised outside microwave_1 and its left gripper lowered near the torso's left side. There is a clear gap between the right hand and the microwave opening. microwave_1 stays open; microwave_turntable_1 and the small pale white_cup_1 inside remain visible, though softened by image resolution. refrigerator_1 remains closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 show no movement or water flow. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 are unchanged. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain together on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 remains clear along the right foreground. upper_cabinet_1 and upper_cabinet_2 remain closed, as do lower_cabinet_1 and lower_cabinet_2. drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain shut.",
      "Frame 25: robot_1 lifts its left arm from the lowered position, extending the left gripper upward toward the outer edge of microwave_1's open door near sink_1. The right arm remains raised on the opposite side, and the base changes little. The left gripper is now close to the door. microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 remain visible within the open microwave cavity. refrigerator_1 is closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain stationary without visible water. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1, and oven_1 remains closed. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1, away from the moving left arm. right_countertop_1 remains empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 26: robot_1 moves its raised left gripper screen-right across the open microwave door's path. The door of microwave_1 is now partly swung inward, reducing the visible width of the cavity. microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 become increasingly obscured by the moving door and robot head. The right arm stays elevated, and the base remains just back from the cabinetry. refrigerator_1 remains closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 show no change or visible water flow. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 remain stationary. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain grouped on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 stays empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 27: robot_1 has shifted slightly forward and screen-right while its left gripper remains near microwave_1's moving door. The door is close to the front opening rather than projecting fully leftward, with only a reduced view into the appliance. microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 are largely hidden. The right gripper remains raised beside the microwave's control side. refrigerator_1 stays closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged without visible flowing water. cooking_pot_1 remains on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1, to the right of the robot. right_countertop_1 is clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain shut.",
      "Frame 28: robot_1 holds close to microwave_1, with its left gripper extended across the front near the door and its left forearm mostly hidden behind the head. The microwave door is nearly flush with the front, and the pale interior is no longer clearly exposed. microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 are obscured. The right arm remains raised and bent beside the control panel. refrigerator_1 is closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain stationary with no visible water stream. cooktop_1 supports cooking_pot_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain grouped on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 stays empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 29: microwave_1's door now appears fully closed, presenting its black window toward the camera. robot_1 begins drawing its left gripper away from the door and toward the left side of its head, while its right arm remains raised. The base stays close to the cabinets. microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 are hidden behind the closed door; their exact positions cannot be checked in this frame. refrigerator_1 is closed; sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged without visible water flow. cooking_pot_1 remains on cooktop_1, and oven_1 stays closed. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 is empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain shut.",
      "Frame 30: robot_1 lowers and extends its left arm outward toward the sink side, moving the left gripper away from microwave_1. Its right arm remains bent upward near the appliance's right-side panel. The base stays nearly fixed in front of the microwave. microwave_1 remains closed, with microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 concealed. refrigerator_1 is closed at the far left. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain stationary, with no visible running water. cooktop_1, cooking_pot_1, and closed oven_1 remain unchanged. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain together on back_countertop_1, below and to the right of the raised right arm. right_countertop_1 remains clear. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 31: robot_1 raises and angles its right gripper inward toward microwave_1's upper-right front and control-panel region. The hand is very close to the appliance, although a distinct button depression cannot be resolved. Its left arm remains bent lower and outward toward sink_1, and the base remains close to the cabinetry. microwave_1 stays closed; microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 remain hidden, with no definite operating-state change visible. refrigerator_1 is closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 show no water flow. cooking_pot_1 stays on cooktop_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 is empty. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 remain closed.",
      "Frame 32: robot_1 maintains the final close stance in front of microwave_1. Its right gripper remains raised near the microwave's right-side front panel, and its left gripper is held lower and outward toward the sink. There is little visible motion relative to the preceding frame. microwave_1 is closed; microwave_turntable_1 and white_cup_1 are not directly visible, and no clear display or heating-state change can be established. refrigerator_1 stays closed. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain unchanged without visible running water. cooktop_1 supports cooking_pot_1 above closed oven_1. lemon_1, lemon_2, and lemon_3 remain grouped on back_countertop_1. right_countertop_1 remains empty beside the robot. upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, lower_cabinet_1, lower_cabinet_2, drawer_1, drawer_2, drawer_3, drawer_4, drawer_5, and drawer_6 all remain closed."
