      "Frame 28: quadruped_robot_1 settles into a wider stance farther from the cabinet than during carton handling. robotic_arm_1 unfolds upward and toward image-left, placing robot_gripper_1 near the left-shifted sliding_cabinet_door_1 and its handle region. storage_cabinet_1 remains open on the right. grocery_carton_1 is still upright inside, and pull_out_cabinet_shelf_1 remains extended with no object on its outer section. The gripper is closer to the door than to the carton, while the body maintains its increased floor clearance from the shelf. left_base_cabinet_1 and left_base_cabinet_2 remain closed; sink_base_cabinet_1 and right_base_cabinet_1 remain unchanged. left_countertop_1, back_countertop_1, and right_countertop_1 remain fixed. oven_1 is closed; stovetop_1 supports cooking_pot_1. sink_1 and faucet_1 show no visible flow. bottle_1 and bottle_2 remain near the left corner, and bottle_3 remains near the sink. window_1 and window_2 are unchanged. wall_shelf_1, wall_shelf_2, wall_shelf_3, and wall_shelf_4 remain stationary. cup_1, cup_2, and cup_3 remain on the lower left shelf; cup_4, cup_5, and cup_6 remain on the lower right shelf.",
      "Frame 29: quadruped_robot_1 remains in its backed-away stance. robotic_arm_1 bends slightly downward and inward, bringing robot_gripper_1 very close to the left-side handle area of sliding_cabinet_door_1. The door is still mostly left-shifted, with storage_cabinet_1's right compartment exposed. grocery_carton_1 remains upright inside the compartment, and pull_out_cabinet_shelf_1 remains extended. Exact gripper-handle contact is difficult to resolve, but the endpoint is aligned with the door rather than the carton. left_base_cabinet_1, left_base_cabinet_2, sink_base_cabinet_1, and right_base_cabinet_1 remain closed and stationary. left_countertop_1, back_countertop_1, and right_countertop_1 are unchanged. oven_1 remains closed, with cooking_pot_1 on stovetop_1. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain inactive. bottle_1 and bottle_2 remain near the stovetop-side corner; bottle_3 remains near the sink. window_1 and window_2 remain unchanged. wall_shelf_1 and wall_shelf_2 remain on the left; wall_shelf_3 and wall_shelf_4 remain on the right. cup_1, cup_2, and cup_3 stay on the lower left shelf, and cup_4, cup_5, and cup_6 stay on the lower right shelf.",
      "Frame 30: sliding_cabinet_door_1 begins moving right across storage_cabinet_1's opening. robotic_arm_1 follows with a rightward endpoint shift, and robot_gripper_1 remains near the door handle area. quadruped_robot_1 holds its stance, so the movement is primarily in the arm and sliding panel. grocery_carton_1 remains visible through the narrowing right-side opening, upright and stationary inside. pull_out_cabinet_shelf_1 stays extended below the moving panel. The gripper remains close to the door and well separated from the carton behind it. left_base_cabinet_1 and left_base_cabinet_2 remain closed, as do sink_base_cabinet_1 and right_base_cabinet_1. left_countertop_1, back_countertop_1, and right_countertop_1 remain fixed. oven_1 is closed, stovetop_1 supports cooking_pot_1, and sink_1 and faucet_1 show no visible flow. bottle_1 and bottle_2 remain near the left corner; bottle_3 remains near the sink. window_1 and window_2 are unchanged. wall_shelf_1, wall_shelf_2, wall_shelf_3, and wall_shelf_4 remain stationary. cup_1, cup_2, and cup_3 remain on the lower left shelf; cup_4, cup_5, and cup_6 remain on the lower right shelf.",
      "Frame 31: sliding_cabinet_door_1 has traveled right to cover storage_cabinet_1's opening. grocery_carton_1 is now occluded by the panel; no movement of the carton itself is visible. robotic_arm_1 is bent upright in front of the cabinet, with robot_gripper_1 near the door's central handle region. quadruped_robot_1 remains stationary at its increased distance from the shelf. pull_out_cabinet_shelf_1 remains extended and visibly empty on its exposed top. The gripper is close to the closed panel, while the body remains separated from the shelf by a short floor gap. left_base_cabinet_1, left_base_cabinet_2, sink_base_cabinet_1, and right_base_cabinet_1 remain closed. left_countertop_1, back_countertop_1, and right_countertop_1 are unchanged. oven_1 remains closed; cooking_pot_1 remains on stovetop_1. sink_1 and faucet_1 remain inactive. bottle_1 and bottle_2 remain near the stovetop-side corner; bottle_3 remains near the sink. window_1 and window_2 are unchanged. wall_shelf_1 and wall_shelf_2 remain on the left, and wall_shelf_3 and wall_shelf_4 remain on the right. cup_1, cup_2, and cup_3 remain on the lower left shelf; cup_4, cup_5, and cup_6 remain on the lower right shelf.",
