      "Frame 27: humanoid_robot_1 faces more squarely toward the camera while maintaining the squat. Its arms hang forward with nearly parallel forearms, and both feet remain planted apart on polished_floor_1. The head and torso appear more centered over the pelvis. robot_beanie_1 remains stable; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang prominently between the arms. living_plant_wall_1 fills the rear right, with staircase_1 and stair_handrail_1 at its base. A person remains by the stairs, and another is visible farther along the steps. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, and orchid_arrangement_1 are outside the frame. chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 fill the left background, with a light-top, blue-jeans person standing near the seating. display_screen_1 appears at far left; standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 remain farther back. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 remain fixed. person_1\u2013person_15 cannot all be uniquely distinguished, and the visible people stay well behind the robot.",
      "Frame 28: humanoid_robot_1 holds a centered, low squat with both knees bent outward and both hands extended downward in front of the pelvis. Its feet remain in contact with polished_floor_1, and the torso begins to appear slightly higher. robot_beanie_1 remains fitted; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang centrally, with the badge clearly visible against the dark pelvis region. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, and stair_handrail_1 remain behind and to the right. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, and orchid_arrangement_1 remain outside the crop. The chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 seating area is broad and visible on the left, with several distant people seated or standing. display_screen_1 is visible at far left; standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 remain less distinct. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 continue framing the room. The light-top, blue-jeans person remains near a column; other person_1\u2013person_15 identities cannot all be confidently assigned.",
      "Frame 29: humanoid_robot_1 rises out of the squat by extending both knees and hips. Its pelvis and torso move upward, and the arms draw back toward its sides rather than reaching forward. Both feet remain separated on polished_floor_1, with increasing knee-to-floor clearance. robot_beanie_1 stays aligned with the head; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 swing slightly as the torso rises. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, and stair_handrail_1 remain in the rear right; the robot remains several meters away from them and from nearby people. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, and orchid_arrangement_1 are offscreen. chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 remain in the left seating area, with display_screen_1 and indistinct standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 farther back. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 are static. Additional green-clad standing people enter the left framing, while the complete person_1\u2013person_15 label mapping remains uncertain.",
      "Frame 30: humanoid_robot_1 reaches an almost fully upright stance, briefly bringing the top of its head close to or beyond the upper image boundary. Its legs are much straighter, feet still apart, and elbows bend as the hands move toward the hips. polished_floor_1 supports both feet and reflects the elongated upright silhouette. robot_beanie_1 is partly limited by the top crop; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang over the chest and abdomen. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, and stair_handrail_1 remain at rear right. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, and orchid_arrangement_1 remain outside the frame. chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 are stationary at left, with display_screen_1 visible and standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 indistinct farther back. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 occupy much of the widened background. Several person_1\u2013person_15 candidates stand or sit around the tables, including two green-toned figures at far left; none is adjacent to the robot.",
      "Frame 31: humanoid_robot_1 stands upright and fully within the frame again, with knees nearly straight, feet shoulder-width apart, elbows angled outward, and both hands near the hips. Its head faces approximately toward the camera. robot_beanie_1 remains on the head; robot_lanyard_1 and robot_identification_badge_1 hang against the upper abdomen with less visible sideways displacement. Both feet contact polished_floor_1, with no other body-floor contact. living_plant_wall_1, staircase_1, and stair_handrail_1 remain behind and to the right across open space. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, and orchid_arrangement_1 are outside the crop. chair_1\u2013chair_8, table_1\u2013table_4, display_screen_1, and the less distinct standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 remain in the left background. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4, overhead_slatted_structure_1, and upper_level_railing_1 remain stationary. The visible person_1\u2013person_15 subset includes people in green tops at far left, a light-top, blue-jeans person near a column, and seated table occupants; individual numbering remains unresolved.",
      "Frame 32: humanoid_robot_1 maintains an upright, front-facing stance with feet apart, knees nearly straight, and both black hands held at the hips or upper pelvis. Its elbows remain bent outward, and only small posture differences are visible from the preceding frame. robot_beanie_1 sits on the head; robot_lanyard_1 hangs vertically, supporting robot_identification_badge_1 against the torso. Both feet remain in contact with polished_floor_1, and the robot touches no other listed object. living_plant_wall_1 occupies the rear right, while staircase_1 and stair_handrail_1 are partly visible at its base. reception_counter_1, backpack_1, and orchid_arrangement_1 remain outside the current view. chair_1\u2013chair_8 and table_1\u2013table_4 form the distant left seating cluster, with display_screen_1 visible and standing_sign_1\u2013standing_sign_2 not clearly separable. support_column_1\u2013support_column_4 support overhead_slatted_structure_1 beneath upper_level_railing_1. Visible members of person_1\u2013person_15 stand or sit several meters behind the robot; the complete one-to-one label assignment remains uncertain. Clear floor space continues to separate the robot from people, furniture, columns, and plants."
