      "Frame 1: robotic_arm_01, the foreground lattice arm, extends diagonally rightward with robotic_gripper_01 just in front of espresso_machine_01, roughly one to two mug widths left of glass_mug_01. robotic_arm_02 and robotic_gripper_02 are farther left beside coffee_grinder_02. The glass mug appears empty and stands left of wooden_coaster_01; espresso_01 is not visible. portafilter_01 has a wooden handle lying near coffee_grinder_01. coffee_tamper_01 is obscured by the foreground assembly. digital_scale_01 sits below the machine's left front, partly hidden; rectangular_tray_01 and tamping_mat_01 occupy the left work area. coffee_grinder_01 and coffee_grinder_02 have upright coffee_bean_hopper_01 and coffee_bean_hopper_02 containing coffee_beans_01 and coffee_beans_02. espresso_machine_drip_tray_01 is clear. steam_wand_01 and steam_wand_02 hang stationary. cleaning_cloth_01 is folded blue on top; coffee_cup_01 through coffee_cup_05 form a partly overlapping white-cup cluster, and metal_pitcher_01 stands nearby. countertop_01 is white; table_01 and chair_01 remain in the caf\u00e9 background.",
      "Frame 2: Both robots remain nearly in their initial configuration. robotic_gripper_01 is suspended close to the lower-left front of espresso_machine_01, still separated from glass_mug_01 by approximately one to two mug widths. robotic_gripper_02 remains beside the left grinder, with no clearly distinguishable grasped object. portafilter_01 remains near coffee_grinder_01. The empty-looking glass_mug_01 and wooden_coaster_01 remain separate; espresso_01 is not visible. coffee_tamper_01 is largely hidden, while digital_scale_01, rectangular_tray_01, and tamping_mat_01 remain in the left work area. Both grinders, both transparent hoppers, and both bean supplies are stationary. espresso_machine_drip_tray_01 is unoccupied by the mug, and both steam wands remain still. The five requested cup identities remain unresolved within the upper white-cup cluster; metal_pitcher_01 and cleaning_cloth_01 are unchanged. countertop_01, background table_01, and chair_01 are stationary.",
      "Frame 3: robotic_arm_02 lifts and swings robotic_gripper_02 slightly upward and toward the grinder work area; its wrist is motion-blurred. robotic_arm_01 remains low, with robotic_gripper_01 near espresso_machine_01 rather than touching glass_mug_01. portafilter_01's wooden handle remains visible on the counter near coffee_grinder_01. glass_mug_01 appears empty, wooden_coaster_01 remains to its right, and espresso_01 is not visible. coffee_tamper_01 remains occluded. digital_scale_01 is partly covered by the foreground arm; rectangular_tray_01 and tamping_mat_01 remain fixed. coffee_grinder_01, coffee_grinder_02, coffee_bean_hopper_01, coffee_bean_hopper_02, coffee_beans_01, and coffee_beans_02 show no visible change. The drip tray and two steam wands remain stationary. cleaning_cloth_01, metal_pitcher_01, and the overlapping coffee_cup_01\u201305 cluster remain on top. The white countertop and background table and chair are unchanged.",
