      "Frame 20: glass_mug_01 stands visibly on espresso_machine_drip_tray_01 beneath portafilter_01. robotic_arm_01 lifts robotic_gripper_01 toward the machine's upper-left control area, leaving the mug upright below; precise fingertip contact with a button is not clearly resolved. robotic_arm_02 remains elevated to the left. The foreground wrist is approximately a mug height above the mug opening. wooden_coaster_01 remains alone on countertop_01. coffee_tamper_01, digital_scale_01, rectangular_tray_01, and tamping_mat_01 remain in place. No distinct liquid stream or espresso_01 level is resolved. Both grinders and their bean-filled hoppers remain stationary. The two steam wands do not move. The five white cups, metal pitcher, blue cloth, and background table and chair retain their positions.",
