      "Frame 8: robot_1 bends its farther elbow and lowers left_robot_gripper_1 toward the front of air_fryer_1. The gripper is now below its preceding position and closer to air_fryer_drawer_handle_1, although still partly separated by the foreground arm in the camera view. right_robot_gripper_1 remains nearly stationary at the far end of that foreground arm. air_fryer_drawer_1 is obscured and not visibly extended. sweet_potato_1, sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 stay on woven_food_tray_1 to the right. countertop_1, closed dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, and closed refrigerator_1 remain unchanged. upper_cabinet_1 and upper_cabinet_2 remain shut; open_shelf_1 still holds green_plate_stack_1 and white_plate_stack_1. potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain stationary. The arm-to-fryer gap is decreasing.",
      "Frame 9: left_robot_gripper_1 descends farther and advances toward air_fryer_drawer_handle_1, becoming partly concealed behind robot_1's foreground arm. The farther white arm link angles down and right from the shoulder. right_robot_gripper_1 stays extended near air_fryer_1, with little visible change. air_fryer_drawer_1 is largely hidden, so finger-to-handle contact cannot be verified. sweet_potato_1 through sweet_potato_5 remain grouped on woven_food_tray_1, with no potato lifted. The robot remains immediately beside countertop_1, and its arms occupy the narrow space between its body and the fryer. dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain stationary; the visible cabinet and appliance doors remain closed.",
      "Frame 10: robot_1 makes a small downward and inward adjustment with its farther arm. left_robot_gripper_1 is low behind the foreground linkage, near the front-handle region of air_fryer_1; its fingers are partly hidden. right_robot_gripper_1 remains close to the appliance on the nearly horizontal foreground arm. air_fryer_drawer_handle_1 and air_fryer_drawer_1 are obscured enough that a secure grasp or opening cannot be confirmed from this view. sweet_potato_1, sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 are unchanged. The left gripper is now much closer to the handle than it was during its raised arc.",
