      "Frame 12: robot_1 remains close to countertop_1 with its foreground arm horizontal and its farther arm lowered toward air_fryer_1. left_robot_gripper_1 stays in the partly occluded air_fryer_drawer_handle_1 region; right_robot_gripper_1 remains nearer the upper-front appliance area. The top caption changes, but the visible arm pose changes only slightly. air_fryer_drawer_1 is mostly hidden, so its exact extension cannot be judged. sweet_potato_1, sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1, with no visible food contact. dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain unchanged. Robot-to-fryer spacing remains small.",
