      "Frame 20: robot_1 is positioned farther left, exposing more of air_fryer_1 and woven_food_tray_1. right_robot_gripper_1 moves over the extended air_fryer_drawer_1; sweet_potato_1 is largely concealed behind the near-vertical arm and drawer edge. left_robot_gripper_1 remains close to air_fryer_drawer_handle_1. The drawer's dark basket opening lies between the robot and the appliance housing. sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on the tray, now clearly separated from the moving gripper. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 retain their previous states. The right gripper is close above the drawer opening, but the exact finger-to-potato relationship is obscured.",
      "Frame 21: robot_1 lowers right_robot_gripper_1 toward or into the opening of air_fryer_drawer_1. Its foreground link remains nearly vertical, blocking part of the interaction. sweet_potato_1 is no longer clearly visible outside the drawer; its precise support and any finger release are occluded. left_robot_gripper_1 remains near air_fryer_drawer_handle_1, and air_fryer_1 stays against tile_backsplash_1. sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1 to the right. countertop_1, closed dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, and wood_floor_1 remain unchanged. The right gripper-to-drawer gap is minimal, while its separation from the tray is greater than during the pickup.",
      "Frame 22: right_robot_gripper_1 remains low at the open air_fryer_drawer_1, with a small downward adjustment of robot_1's foreground arm. sweet_potato_1 is hidden within the gripper-and-drawer region rather than visibly suspended over woven_food_tray_1. left_robot_gripper_1 stays adjacent to air_fryer_drawer_handle_1. The main air_fryer_1 housing remains stationary, with the drawer still projecting toward the robot. sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain supported by the tray. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain fixed. The exact release instant is not visible through the overlapping arm and appliance components.",
      "Frame 23: robot_1 holds its foreground arm almost upright, with right_robot_gripper_1 near the open air_fryer_drawer_1. No potato is clearly visible between the exposed gripper components. sweet_potato_1 remains out of direct view after the gripper entered the drawer region; its exact position inside cannot be inspected. left_robot_gripper_1 is still near air_fryer_drawer_handle_1, and the drawer remains outward from air_fryer_1. sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 are unchanged. The top caption changes to a drawer-closing instruction, but the basket is not yet visibly fully seated.",
      "Frame 24: robot_1 lifts right_robot_gripper_1 upward and away from air_fryer_drawer_1, increasing clearance over the opening. The fingers appear unoccupied where visible; sweet_potato_1 is not visible outside the drawer. left_robot_gripper_1 remains nearer air_fryer_drawer_handle_1 on the farther arm. air_fryer_drawer_1 is still visibly extended from air_fryer_1. sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1, with no additional food movement. countertop_1, closed dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain stationary. The foreground arm is tall and nearly vertical; the inset remains at upper left.",
      "Frame 25: right_robot_gripper_1 stays elevated above the fryer front while robot_1 adjusts its farther arm toward air_fryer_drawer_handle_1. left_robot_gripper_1 is partly hidden behind the upright foreground linkage, close to the drawer's outer face. air_fryer_drawer_1 remains visibly outward from air_fryer_1, though its separation appears to be decreasing slightly. sweet_potato_1 remains hidden in the drawer region; sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 stay on woven_food_tray_1. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 retain their positions. The robot remains close to the counter edge, with neither gripper near the remaining potatoes.",
      "Frame 26: robot_1's farther arm extends toward air_fryer_1, placing left_robot_gripper_1 near air_fryer_drawer_handle_1 as air_fryer_drawer_1 moves inward. The drawer opening is narrower than in the earlier fully extended position, although the upright foreground arm obscures part of its travel. right_robot_gripper_1 remains raised above the drawer, with no visible food. sweet_potato_1 remains concealed; sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1. The upper-left inset is fading. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain unchanged. The drawer's distance from its housing decreases while the robot body stays almost stationary.",
      "Frame 27: The inset has disappeared, leaving the main kitchen view unobstructed. robot_1 extends its farther arm toward the fryer front; left_robot_gripper_1 remains near air_fryer_drawer_handle_1. air_fryer_drawer_1 is closer to the air_fryer_1 housing, with only a limited outward projection visible around the occluding foreground arm. right_robot_gripper_1 remains elevated on the nearly upright arm. sweet_potato_1 is not directly visible; sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain stationary. The left gripper is close to the appliance front, whereas the right gripper has vertical clearance above it.",
      "Frame 28: robot_1 lowers and advances its farther arm slightly. left_robot_gripper_1 reaches the air_fryer_drawer_handle_1 region, and air_fryer_drawer_1 slides farther into air_fryer_1. The dark basket opening is now difficult to see and largely blocked by the front panel and arm. right_robot_gripper_1 remains high beside the upright foreground linkage, away from woven_food_tray_1. sweet_potato_1 remains concealed in the appliance region; sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on the tray. countertop_1, closed dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 are unchanged. The drawer-to-housing gap continues to narrow.",
      "Frame 29: air_fryer_drawer_1 appears nearly or fully seated within air_fryer_1. left_robot_gripper_1 is low near air_fryer_drawer_handle_1, with its black fingers overlapping the handle area. robot_1's farther arm extends across the gap from the column to the fryer, while right_robot_gripper_1 remains elevated on the foreground arm. sweet_potato_1 is hidden from view behind the drawer front; sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1 without displacement. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain fixed. The robot body stays close to the counter, and the left gripper is at minimal visible distance from the closed-front region.",
      "Frame 30: robot_1 holds left_robot_gripper_1 near air_fryer_drawer_handle_1 with little visible motion. air_fryer_drawer_1 appears seated flush with the lower front of air_fryer_1, with no clearly exposed basket opening. right_robot_gripper_1 remains raised and does not visibly hold food. sweet_potato_1 remains out of sight within the appliance region established by the preceding movement. sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1 to the right. countertop_1, closed dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 are unchanged. The drawer no longer projects conspicuously toward the robot.",
      "Frame 31: robot_1 bends and lifts its farther arm away from the low handle position. left_robot_gripper_1 rises and retracts, becoming partly hidden behind the foreground upright arm; its separation from air_fryer_drawer_handle_1 increases. right_robot_gripper_1 remains elevated near the upper-front region of air_fryer_1. air_fryer_drawer_1 stays seated and does not move outward. sweet_potato_1 remains hidden; sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 stay on woven_food_tray_1. countertop_1, dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, lower_cabinet_1, refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 remain stationary. Both arms are now held higher than during the drawer's inward movement, while the robot body remains beside the counter.",
      "Frame 32: robot_1 holds nearly the same final pose, with the foreground arm upright and the farther arm bent upward. right_robot_gripper_1 remains near the upper-front fryer region; left_robot_gripper_1 is partly occluded after retracting from air_fryer_drawer_handle_1. No potato is visibly held. air_fryer_drawer_1 remains seated in air_fryer_1, and the handle projects from the closed front. sweet_potato_1 is not directly visible; the preceding sequence places its last visible movement at the drawer opening. sweet_potato_2, sweet_potato_3, sweet_potato_4, and sweet_potato_5 remain on woven_food_tray_1. countertop_1, closed dishwasher_1, dishwasher_handle_1, closed lower_cabinet_1, closed refrigerator_1, upper_cabinet_1, upper_cabinet_2, open_shelf_1, green_plate_stack_1, white_plate_stack_1, potted_plant_1, plant_pot_1, tile_backsplash_1, and wood_floor_1 are unchanged. The robot remains within close reach of the fryer, with the tray farther to the right and clear of either gripper."
