      "Frame 25: The robot raises the large bowl slightly from its lowest visible position while keeping it partly cropped at the left boundary. Its open interior remains visible, and the black gripper continues holding the right rim. Bowl_3 stays unmoved on table_1 to the right, separated from the held bowl by a narrow but visible gap. Bowl_2 cannot be separately identified. Robot_arm_1's elbow-like bend and pale-blue joint remain prominent above the wrist. Bin_1 remains beneath the left foreground area without visible contact from the bowl. Crate_1, cabinet_1, laptop_1, stand_1, and stand_2 retain their background positions.",
