      "Frame 28: robotic_arm_2 shifts its upper links near the right edge, with its gripper briefly higher and less visible, while remaining separated from the central objects. robotic_arm_1 stays retracted. paper_towel_roll_1 and metal_towel_holder_1 retain their upright, slightly left-leaning arrangement, and empty_cardboard_tube_1 remains diagonally on worktable_1. The holder's circular base is still fully on the tabletop. metal_mounting_rail_1, metal_mounting_rail_2, clamp_1, clamp_2, and clamp_3 remain fixed; clamp_4 remains visually unresolved. background_table_1, plastic_storage_bin_1, office_chair_1, cable_bundle_1, and cloth_bundle_1 retain their positions.",
