      "Frame 19: More of humanoid_robot_01 re-enters at left, including its black torso, bent forearm, and part of a leg. Its hand remains in front of its waist, to the left of barrier_post_01 and below or near belt height. The post is roughly within an arm's reach, while paper_sign_01 is farther right along barrier_belt_01. barrier_post_02 remains off-screen. No hand-to-post or hand-to-belt contact is clearly shown. paved_path_01 supports the robot and circular post base; lawn_01 begins directly beyond. tree_01 through tree_06 remain distant, partly overlapping in the backlight. hedge_01 and bush_01 appear as darker vegetation. building_01 and building_02 remain partially obscured. ring_sculpture_01 is faintly visible deeper in the scene. distant_person_01 is unresolved. The sign remains draped over the belt without a major change in shape.",
      "Frame 20: humanoid_robot_01 is visible from its head to lower legs at the left, standing substantially more upright than in the opening frames. Its elbows are bent and hands held in front of the abdomen; its head faces toward screen right. barrier_post_01 stands just ahead and to its right, approximately one short step away. barrier_belt_01 extends rightward at about the robot's waist-to-forearm height in this perspective, with paper_sign_01 farther along it. barrier_post_02 remains off-screen. paved_path_01 lies beneath the robot, and lawn_01 is adjacent behind. tree_01 through tree_06 remain across the background, with sunlight obscuring some outlines. hedge_01 and bush_01 remain stationary vegetation. building_01 and building_02 are partially visible beyond the trees. ring_sculpture_01 is small in the middle distance. distant_person_01 is not distinctly identifiable.",
      "Frame 21: humanoid_robot_01 is almost fully visible at left, upright with slightly bent knees and hands held forward around waist height. Its feet are on paved_path_01, and it remains facing right. barrier_post_01 is approximately a short step ahead; the closest hand is separated from the post and belt by a visible gap. paper_sign_01 hangs a further lateral distance to the right on barrier_belt_01. barrier_post_02 remains beyond the right edge. lawn_01 lies immediately behind the barrier. tree_01 through tree_06 remain in the distant background, some partially hidden by the robot or glare. hedge_01 continues behind the lawn, and bush_01 begins to be more apparent along the left-side vegetation. building_01 and building_02 remain partly screened. ring_sculpture_01 is visible in the distant central-left area. distant_person_01 is not clearly resolved. Shadows extend toward the foreground.",
      "Frame 22: humanoid_robot_01 stands left of barrier_post_01 with its torso nearly vertical, knees slightly flexed, and arms bent forward. Both feet are visible on paved_path_01, with a small fore-aft separation. The post remains roughly one step away, and paper_sign_01 hangs farther right on barrier_belt_01 at approximately mid-torso height in the image. barrier_post_02 is still outside the crop. lawn_01 begins just behind the paved strip. tree_01 through tree_06 remain several to many meters beyond the robot, their outlines partly merged by backlighting. hedge_01 and bush_01 are stationary; the bush occupies the left-side planting area. building_01 and building_02 remain distant and partially hidden. ring_sculpture_01 is small but visible behind the robot and post. distant_person_01 cannot be distinguished. No barrier movement or clear robot contact is visible.",
      "Frame 23: humanoid_robot_01 widens its stance and bends forward slightly at the hips while lowering its hands. One foot is farther left and behind the other, producing a broader base on paved_path_01. barrier_post_01 stands ahead near the center; barrier_post_02 now enters prominently at the right foreground as a thick black upright. barrier_belt_01 connects the posts, with paper_sign_01 hanging between them. The robot is roughly a short step from barrier_post_01 and farther from barrier_post_02. lawn_01 is directly beyond the barrier. tree_01 through tree_06 remain in the background, partly occluded by the robot, posts, and glare. hedge_01 and bush_01 line the lawn, with the bush visible at left. building_01 and building_02 remain behind foliage. ring_sculpture_01 stands in the distant center-left. distant_person_01 is unresolved.",
