      "Frame 25: humanoid_robot_01 descends into a deep squat on paved_path_01. Its thighs angle close to horizontal, torso leans forward, head drops substantially below its earlier standing height, and both hands extend low in front. Its feet remain planted with a broad separation. barrier_post_01 is close to the robot's forward side, with its circular base a short distance from the nearest foot and hand. barrier_post_02 stands in the right foreground. barrier_belt_01 crosses above the robot's lowered torso, and paper_sign_01 hangs above and ahead of its head. lawn_01 remains immediately behind the barrier. tree_01 through tree_06 continue in the background, partly occluded and backlit. hedge_01 and bush_01 remain unchanged, with dense bush foliage at left. building_01 and building_02 stay distant and screened. ring_sculpture_01 is visible near the central background. distant_person_01 is indistinct.",
      "Frame 26: humanoid_robot_01 lowers further from the squat, bringing its upper body closer to paved_path_01. One hand reaches down beside barrier_post_01's circular base, while its knees bend sharply and its head moves below barrier_belt_01. The nearest hand appears within a hand-length of the post base, though contact with the post is not clear. barrier_post_02 remains a large foreground upright at right. paper_sign_01 hangs above the robot's forward path and remains attached to the belt. lawn_01 begins just behind the post bases. tree_01 through tree_06 remain distant and stationary, their individual boundaries partly obscured by glare and overlap. hedge_01 and bush_01 stay along the lawn edge. building_01 and building_02 remain behind foliage. ring_sculpture_01 is upright in the background. distant_person_01 is not clearly visible.",
