      "Frame 29: humanoid_robot_01 continues rightward on hands and knees, its head emerging to the right of foreground barrier_post_02. The torso stays low, with one arm reaching forward and the other supporting the body near the pavement. Its rear legs remain left of the head, close to the barrier bases. barrier_post_02 centrally occludes part of the torso; barrier_post_01 is behind it and farther from the camera. barrier_belt_01 and paper_sign_01 remain above and behind the robot's lowered back. The robot's leading end is now on the right side of the barrier in the image, with small clearance beneath the belt. paved_path_01 supports its contact points; lawn_01 is adjacent behind. tree_01 through tree_06, hedge_01, and bush_01 remain stationary. building_01 and building_02 stay partly hidden. ring_sculpture_01 remains in the distance; distant_person_01 is unresolved.",
      "Frame 30: humanoid_robot_01 advances farther right, extending its leading arm along paved_path_01 while keeping its head low and torso nearly horizontal. One knee is tucked beneath the pelvis and the other leg trails, with a rear foot lifted. barrier_post_02 is now left of the robot's head and shoulders and obscures part of its rear body. barrier_post_01 remains farther behind near the lawn edge. barrier_belt_01 and paper_sign_01 are above and to the left of the robot's leading end; no direct contact is evident. The head-to-barrier separation has increased to roughly a fraction of the robot's body length, while the trailing legs remain close to the bases. lawn_01, tree_01 through tree_06, hedge_01, and bush_01 remain unchanged in the background. building_01 and building_02 are partly screened. ring_sculpture_01 remains visible; distant_person_01 is not distinct.",
      "Frame 31: humanoid_robot_01 is mostly to the right of barrier_post_02, crawling with its head forward, back nearly level, one arm extended, and the other more vertical under its chest. One bent knee is beneath the body, while the opposite leg extends backward toward the barrier. Its head and hands are farther from the posts than its trailing feet, which remain near the post bases. barrier_post_02 stands left of center in the foreground; barrier_post_01 is behind it. barrier_belt_01 is visible between the uprights, and paper_sign_01 hangs near the farther post. paved_path_01 carries sharp, long shadows from the robot and posts. lawn_01 lies immediately behind. tree_01 through tree_06, hedge_01, and bush_01 remain distant and stationary. building_01 and building_02 remain partly hidden by trees and glare. ring_sculpture_01 is upright in the background. distant_person_01 is not resolved.",
