      "Frame 26: robotic_arm_1 has raised airpods_charging_case_5 from the left compartment and holds it in robotic_gripper_1 above the tray's left-center edge. The left compartment of transparent_compartmented_tray_1 now appears empty. robotic_arm_2 lowers robotic_gripper_2 toward airpods_earbud_group_2 in the right compartment, with its fingers near the loose pieces. airpods_earbud_group_1 remains scattered in the middle compartment. airpods_charging_case_1, airpods_charging_case_2, airpods_charging_case_3, and airpods_charging_case_4 remain on wooden_work_surface_1 in the same foreground cluster. The grippers are separated horizontally by several case widths. robot_cable_bundle_1 is draped around the lifted left forearm, and robot_cable_bundle_2 curves beside the descending right wrist. perforated_metal_work_surface_1, robot_mounting_frame_1, and transparent_safety_panel_1 remain unchanged. No individual right-compartment piece is reliably visible inside the right fingers.",
      "Frame 27: robotic_arm_2 lifts robotic_gripper_2 from the right compartment, rotating its fingers inward toward the elevated airpods_charging_case_5. robotic_arm_1 holds that case steadily in robotic_gripper_1 above the tray's center-left. The gripper-to-case gap has decreased to a few case widths. airpods_charging_case_1, airpods_charging_case_2, airpods_charging_case_3, and airpods_charging_case_4 remain on wooden_work_surface_1. transparent_compartmented_tray_1 has an apparently empty left compartment; airpods_earbud_group_1 and airpods_earbud_group_2 remain in its middle and right compartments. A small white detail near the right fingers is not sufficiently clear to identify as a particular earbud. robot_cable_bundle_2 rises with the right wrist, and robot_cable_bundle_1 stays slack along the left arm. perforated_metal_work_surface_1, robot_mounting_frame_1, and transparent_safety_panel_1 remain fixed.",
      "Frame 28: robotic_arm_1 reaches slightly farther right as robotic_arm_2 brings robotic_gripper_2 inward. robotic_gripper_1 holds airpods_charging_case_5 between the two opposing grippers, with robotic_gripper_2 at contact or near-contact distance. The interaction occurs above the tray's center-right area, not at the compartment floor. airpods_charging_case_1, airpods_charging_case_2, airpods_charging_case_3, and airpods_charging_case_4 remain on wooden_work_surface_1. airpods_earbud_group_1 and airpods_earbud_group_2 remain below in transparent_compartmented_tray_1; the left compartment remains empty. robot_cable_bundle_1 follows the extended left forearm, while robot_cable_bundle_2 loops around the inward-facing right wrist. perforated_metal_work_surface_1, robot_mounting_frame_1, and transparent_safety_panel_1 remain stationary. The fingers hide most of the held case's opening or seam, so internal contents cannot be determined.",
      "Frame 29: Both arms maintain their inward-facing positions. robotic_gripper_1 continues holding airpods_charging_case_5, and robotic_gripper_2 remains immediately adjacent to its right side, with small wrist or finger alignment changes visible. robotic_arm_1 is extended across the left half of the tray; robotic_arm_2 is bent down from the upper right. airpods_charging_case_1, airpods_charging_case_2, airpods_charging_case_3, and airpods_charging_case_4 remain in the foreground on wooden_work_surface_1. airpods_earbud_group_1 and airpods_earbud_group_2 remain scattered in the center and right compartments of transparent_compartmented_tray_1, with its left compartment empty. robot_cable_bundle_1 and robot_cable_bundle_2 hang loosely around their respective wrists. perforated_metal_work_surface_1, robot_mounting_frame_1, and transparent_safety_panel_1 remain fixed. The held case stays several case lengths behind the resting foreground cases.",
      "Frame 30: robotic_gripper_1 and robotic_gripper_2 remain nearly touching around airpods_charging_case_5 above the tray. robotic_arm_1 holds the case at a consistent height, while robotic_arm_2 makes a slight orientation adjustment. No release or clearly resolved component movement is visible. airpods_charging_case_1, airpods_charging_case_2, airpods_charging_case_3, and airpods_charging_case_4 remain stationary on wooden_work_surface_1. airpods_earbud_group_1 and airpods_earbud_group_2 remain in the middle and right compartments of transparent_compartmented_tray_1, and the left compartment remains empty. robot_cable_bundle_1 runs along the left arm with a loose loop behind it; robot_cable_bundle_2 curves beside the right forearm. perforated_metal_work_surface_1 and robot_mounting_frame_1 remain visible behind the tray. transparent_safety_panel_1 remains fixed at the foreground boundary. The exact relationship between the right finger tips and the case interior is occluded.",
      "Frame 31: robotic_arm_2 retracts robotic_gripper_2 slightly upward and right, creating a small but clearer gap from airpods_charging_case_5. robotic_arm_1 still supports that case in robotic_gripper_1 above the tray's center-right region. The case is not touching either work surface. airpods_charging_case_1, airpods_charging_case_2, airpods_charging_case_3, and airpods_charging_case_4 remain on wooden_work_surface_1, grouped across the foreground center. airpods_earbud_group_1 and airpods_earbud_group_2 remain in the middle and right compartments of transparent_compartmented_tray_1; the left compartment stays empty. robot_cable_bundle_2 shifts with the withdrawing right wrist, while robot_cable_bundle_1 remains draped around the extended left arm. perforated_metal_work_surface_1, robot_mounting_frame_1, and transparent_safety_panel_1 remain stationary. The right gripper is now farther from the held case than in the preceding two frames.",
      "Frame 32: robotic_arm_1 has extended diagonally forward and right, lowering robotic_gripper_1 to the front-right edge of transparent_compartmented_tray_1. airpods_charging_case_5 is visible at the lower fingers, close to or contacting wooden_work_surface_1 beside the existing foreground cases; the image does not establish whether it has been released. airpods_charging_case_1, airpods_charging_case_2, airpods_charging_case_3, and airpods_charging_case_4 remain on the wooden surface, with the fourth case nearest the lowered gripper. robotic_arm_2 holds robotic_gripper_2 horizontally above the tray's right half, several case widths away from the left gripper. airpods_earbud_group_1 and airpods_earbud_group_2 remain in the middle and right compartments, partly occluded by the forward-reaching left arm; the left compartment is empty. robot_cable_bundle_1 bends around the extended arm, and robot_cable_bundle_2 remains looped near the right wrist. perforated_metal_work_surface_1, robot_mounting_frame_1, and transparent_safety_panel_1 remain fixed."
